function adminDate(v){if(!v)return 'Fecha de ingreso pendiente';const [y,m,d]=String(v).split('-');return y&&m&&d?`Ingreso: ${d}/${m}/${y}`:`Ingreso: ${v}`}
function filterText(v){return String(v||'').normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'').toLowerCase()}
function employeeNameParts(e){if(e.apellido_paterno||e.apellido_materno)return {names:String(e.nombres||'').trim(),paternal:String(e.apellido_paterno||'').trim(),maternal:String(e.apellido_materno||'').trim(),inferred:false};const clean=String(e.nombres||'').replace(/\s*\([^)]*\)\s*$/,'').replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim(),tokens=clean.split(' ').filter(Boolean);if(tokens.length<3)return {names:clean,paternal:'',maternal:'',inferred:false};const maternal=tokens.pop();let paternal=tokens.pop();const previous=filterText(tokens[tokens.length-1]);if(['de','del'].includes(previous))paternal=`${tokens.pop()} ${paternal}`;else if(previous==='la'&&filterText(tokens[tokens.length-2])==='de')paternal=`${tokens.splice(-2).join(' ')} ${paternal}`;return {names:tokens.join(' '),paternal,maternal,inferred:true}}
